# POCKET Doctrine

- **Job:** Money plan that cannot overspend. The approved plan is the only permission.
- **Surface:** ChatGPT-like consumer chat (voice + one thread). Crypto stays under the hood.
- **Account:** Privy-primary (embedded wallet, gas sponsorship, policies). Mera PRF only for encrypted memory — never the entire account layer.
- **Network:** Monad testnet only (chain ID 10143) until mainnet dust. Drop features with no testnet/devnet.
- **Track:** Consumer Products & Payments. Do not bend into trading UI or Agora remittance-only apps.
- **Honesty:** Never fake settles. Never claim unhackable. Label testnet.
- **No mocks / no half-done:** Live rails or do not ship the feature.

